---
title: "accrue_interest_for_market_and_obligation (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_calc_time: now = clock_timestamp_ms / 1000
    q_calc_time --> q_accrue_market: market::accrue_all_interests(market, now)
    q_accrue_market --> q_accrue_obligation: obligation::accrue_interests(obligation, market)
    q_accrue_obligation --> [*]: interests accrued for market and obligation

    note right of q_accrue_market
        INV-001: interest accrual is idempotent for same timestamp
        INV-002: market interest models determine per-asset accrual rates
    end note

    note right of q_accrue_obligation
        INV-003: obligation debt reflects latest accrued interest from market
        INV-004: anyone can trigger interest accrual (permissionless)
    end note
